      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RED ROCK LOTUS (2) was quickly out of the tricky draw with a fast early sectional and clocked 23.10 with a 5 length win at this track over 400m. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Expected to be right there at the finish again. FADING FLAME (1) has been hard to follow lately, running seventh (17.86) last time but prior to that ran very well when placed at Sale. Well placed here and should do much better. MASTER LEHIGH (7) has a strong record here with three wins and a minor from seven starts. Missed the frame latest (18.86) when sixth over 320m at Wagga in a Grade 5. Looks suited here and can measure up. SCOTCH ALL ROUND (3) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
